summary:
  An audition leaves nothing behind for Play to bring back, and the first
  station of the list plays in its place.

history:
  The library can answer "audition" only if previewStation wrote down what
  was auditioned, with its codec and bitrate: those decide the relay road,
  and an Ogg audition without them wedges after a second.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          root._lastAudition = { "name": name, "url": url, "favicon": favicon, "uuid": rbUuid,

replace:
          root._lastAudition = null && { "name": name, "url": url, "favicon": favicon, "uuid": rbUuid,

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_only_an_audition_is_remembered_and_every_other_start_forgets_it.
  Line-neutral.
